(29,080 observations deleted)

. 
.         * I noticed that participants in my sample seem to have been asked qu
> estions
.         * about the position of women in society in one year only (2016, 2017
>  or 
.         * 2018. Since I didn't have access to the full dataset and I could no
> t 
.         * find information to confirm this, I checked how many participants w
> ith
.         * valid answers in one year (1-7) had not been asked the question in 
> other
.         * years when the question was being asked ([-5] Not included in this 
.         * version of the questionnaire)
.         * Generate indicator for valid response (1-7)
.         gen valid_response = inrange(plj0621, 1, 7)

.         * Generate indicator for "not included" (-5)
.         gen not_included = (plj0621 == -5)

.         * Summarise by pid
.         bysort pid: egen n_valid = total(valid_response)

.         bysort pid: egen n_not_included = total(not_included)

.         bysort pid: egen n_obs = count(plj0621)

.         * Identify pids with exactly 1 valid response and other obs as -5
.         gen one_valid_others_not_included = (n_valid == 1 & n_valid + n_not_i
> ncluded == n_obs)

