. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H1 *
. 
.         * I run a linear OLS regression analysis with the PCA of the 5 variab
> les for
.         * support for the more equal position of women in society (plj0621-pl
> j0625) as
.         * dependent variable and the total number of daughters as independent
>  variable.
.         * The controls are the ones listed in the PAP, with adjustments as 
.         * documented below.
.         * _b[total_daughters] is the test for H1.
.         reg pc_women total_daughters i.total_kids age2_100 loghinc ///
>         pgbilzeit ft_employed i.marital_stat east_germany i.migback ib3.hgnut
> s1 ///
>         i.syear
